     "p": {
      "ar": "`smtplib.SMTP_SSL(host, 465)` أو `SMTP(host, 587)` مع `starttls()`، و`login(user, password)` و`send_message(msg)`. Gmail ومعظم الخدمات مش بتقبل باسورد حسابك العادي؛ اعمل «App password» (بعد تفعيل التحقق بخطوتين) وحطه في `.env` — عمره ما يتكتب في الكود. وفيه حد يومي للإرسال، فللإيميلات الكتير استخدم خدمة إرسال (أو n8n).",
      "en": "`smtplib.SMTP_SSL(host, 465)`, or `SMTP(host, 587)` with `starttls()`, then `login(user, password)` and `send_message(msg)`. Gmail and most providers reject your normal account password; create an «App password» (after turning on two-step verification) and keep it in `.env` — never in the code. There is a daily sending limit, so for bulk email use a sending service (or n8n)."
     },
     "ex": "import os, smtplib, ssl\nfrom email.message import EmailMessage\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\n\nload_dotenv()\nmsg = EmailMessage()\nmsg[\"Subject\"] = \"Test from Python\"\nmsg[\"From\"] = os.environ[\"SMTP_USER\"]\nmsg[\"To\"] = os.environ[\"SMTP_USER\"]          # send to yourself first\nmsg.set_content(\"It works.\")\nwith smtplib.SMTP_SSL(os.environ.get(\"SMTP_HOST\", \"smtp.gmail.com\"), 465, context=ssl.create_default_context()) as s:\n    s.login(os.environ[\"SMTP_USER\"], os.environ[\"SMTP_APP_PASSWORD\"])\n    s.send_message(msg)\nprint(\"sent\")"
